commitments.text:
5(2) BC Hydro and TransAlta must comply with all applicable orders, directions and 
conditions, and obtain and comply with all applicable tenures, licences, regulations, 
approvals, standards and permits, or other authorities, which may include or result from, 
but are not necessarily limited to, the following provincial enactments:
a) Commercial Transport Act, RSBC 1996, c. 58; 
b) Electrical Safety Act, RSBC 1996, c. 109; 
c) Highway Act, RSBC 1996, c. 188; 
d) Municipal Act, RSBC 1996 C. 323; 
e) Pipeline Act, RSBC 1996, c. 364; 
f) Transport of Dangerous Goods Act, RSBC 1996, c. 458; 
g) Utilities Commission Act, RSBC 1996, c. 473; 
h) Waste Management Act, RSBC 1996, c. 482; and 
i) Water Act, RSBC 1996, c. 483.
